  "ruleText": "Saf-C 408.20 Removal of Moorings. The commissioner shall remove or cause the removal of any mooring, when authorized pursuant to RSA 270:66, I.\n\nSource. #8172, eff 9-21-04 (from Saf-C 408.17); ss by #10293, eff 3-20-13",
